    "body": "fix on issue/1896-thread-pass-ends-decision · PR #2128 · pinned by every_pass_runs_to_the_posted_end_z_inside_the_root_pass (unchanged assertion) · merges when reviewed\n\nThe plan changed after the claim. The PR takes the second \"Done means\" choice: a decision records why the laid ends stay. A partial arc to D ends off the meridian plane, and the holder law, the rapid law, both lathe posts and the two thread verdicts do not accept that. The decision file lists the reasons and the cost of a later change.\n",
